Package.resolved

# Vapor
# Any .env, wherever it is (a stray copy at the repo root held real keys).
# .env.example and Server/.env.testing don't match and stay tracked.
.env

# NOTE: Server/Public/css/*.css used to be blanket-ignored here, written
# at M1 in anticipation of a future Tailwind CLI build step (architecture
# doc §15) generating compiled output into this directory. It silently
# swallowed M7's hand-written home.css and design-tokens.css too --
# `git status` never flags an ignored file as untracked, so this went
# unnoticed until caught while preparing PR #7. Removed rather than
# patched with per-file negations: right now nothing generates CSS into
# this directory, so there's no actual build artifact to hide. When the
# real Tailwind build step ships, give ITS specific output filename its
# own ignore rule instead of blanket-ignoring the whole directory again.

# macOS
.DS_Store

